// GLSL includes' functions are #included from the shared .hlsli files, the rest is inlined as the loader does. Fusion Shaders (F4FS) feeds it the GL-side inputs
// named in notes/vkcompute1/hlsl_plan.md. Wired on Vulkan by lane VKSKY1 (vkpresent.cpp skyRun, WW_VKVIEW=1).
// The view ray, acos and atHitsGround below are spelled as NVIDIA's GL compiler lowers them (tests/vkframe/skyview.sh).
// profile: ps_6_0
